From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:21:49 -0500
Subject: feat: a Settings switch for Warn Before Quitting (issue 88)

Pages and menus has "Hold Cmd-Q to quit" on the Mac, bound to the same
local-state pref as the Stedding menu's Warn Before Quitting (settings T60).
Off, Cmd-Q quits at once.

Why: GitHub issue 88 asked for Cmd-Q to quit at once. The menu's switch was
the one way to get that, and people did not find it.

Removable when: Chromium puts Warn Before Quitting in its own settings.
---
 .../api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc        |  6 +++++
 .../stedding_page/stedding_page.html.ts       |  7 ++++++
 .../browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_ui.cc  |  8 +++++++
 .../stedding/settings_spaces_browsertest.cc   | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 43 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc b/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc
index f6814c794b6b8..b8da369acbbff 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/extensions/api/settings_private/prefs_util.cc
@@ -461,6 +461,12 @@ const PrefsUtil::TypedPrefMap& PrefsUtil::GetAllowlistedKeys() {
   // toolbar T55, settings T51 (BACKLOG S-392).
   (*s_allowlist)[stedding::prefs::kCameraRowFullscreen] =
       settings_api::PrefType::kBoolean;
+#if BUILDFLAG(IS_MAC)
+  // settings T60 (GitHub issue 88): the Mac menu's Warn Before Quitting, in
+  // local state, as a switch of the page too.
+  (*s_allowlist)[::prefs::kConfirmToQuitEnabled] =
+      settings_api::PrefType::kBoolean;
+#endif
   // drm-notice Dn8, settings T56.
   (*s_allowlist)[stedding::prefs::kDrmNoticeDismissedSites] =
       settings_api::PrefType::kList;
